        "category": null,
        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p><strong>Trigger </strong>Ashgut's turn ends and Lifewaster was not triggered last turn.</p><hr /><p>Rearing on her hind legs, Ashgut prepares to unleash the full power of her umbral breath on her enemies.</p><p>At the beginning of her next turn, she floods the arena with pure darkness, chilling everything touching a surface. She deals @Damage[16d6[void]] damage with a @Check[type:fortitude|dc:34|basic:true] save to all creatures and objects in the arena in contact with the ground or a wall. Undead or creatures with negative healing take the same amount of force damage, instead of negative damage. Creatures adjacent to or impaled by one of Fjordcarver's ethereal stalagmites treat their saving throw as one degree better (this does not stack with Evasion or similar abilities).</p>"
        },
