        "actions": {
          "value": null
        },
        "category": null,
        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>Ashgut continually emits a choking smog from her body that complicates aerial combat. While Ahsgut is alive, all flying and air-walking creatures in the arena must hold their breath or suffocate, and their visibility is reduced to 5 feet due to the intense watering of their eyes. Fjordcarver is unaffected by this ability during his slight hover, but will become affected by it if he flies higher.</p>"
        },
