          "version": 0.953
        },
        "actionType": {
          "value": "passive"
        },
        "actions": {
          "value": null
        },
        "category": null,
        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>Ashgut's pure focus on her rivalry with Fjordcarver has shrouded her mind in darkness. Ashgut is immune to mental damage (but not other mental effects, this has been added as 999 mental resistance for automation purposes). Additionally, Psychic Spears does not target Ashgut.</p><p>Although she is a dragon, Ashgut's wings are too injured to be useful, and she cannot fly as a result. If Ashgut is not touching the ground, or in contact with a solid surface that is touching the ground (such as a wall while climbing), she is off-guard.</p>"
        },
