        "category": null,
        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>Ashgut's presence rots the land she walks on. When a creature other than Ashgut ends their turn on Ashgut's side of the arena, they lose any mental weakness they have but gain weakness to negative equal to half their level (rounded up). If a creature is moved into the Blighted Fields area outside of their turn, the effect applies at the end of that turn.</p><p>If Fjordcarver dies, Blighted Fields expands to cover the entire arena.</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.covalon.gornlar-items.Item.nzqny6MIIZwzyjVM]{Effect: Blighted Fields / Mindbending Fields}</p>"
        },
